{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 📓 人月神話\nThe Mythical Man-Month",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 1089,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 147,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ⏳ 人月與進度",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 258,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-布魯克斯定律.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**人月是神話**\n人力與時間不可簡單互換"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 335,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**溝通成本呈平方成長**\nn 人有 n(n-1)/2 條溝通路徑"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-4",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**新人要訓練**\n加人到落後專案，短期只會更慢"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🏛 概念完整性",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 861,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 675,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-概念完整性.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 865,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**架構與實作分離**\n由少數架構師守護一致的設計理念"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**寧可少幾個功能**\n也要維持統一的設計理念"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ⚠️ 第二系統效應",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1296,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1205,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**設計第二個系統時最危險**\n第一個保守、第二個放縱"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**過度設計、堆砌功能**\n把所有壓抑的點子一次塞進去"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🔫 沒有銀彈",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1731,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1545,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-沒有銀彈.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1735,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**本質複雜度**\n軟體固有的複雜，無法靠工具消除"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**附屬複雜度**\n工具與語言可解的那一部分"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 👥 外科手術隊伍",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2166,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 68,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 2075,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**小而精的團隊**\n圍繞少數頂尖者組織"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 2220,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**明確分工**\n其餘成員支援「主刀者」，而非平均分攤"
    }
  ],
